      "text": "Luna flew above the gate, then dipped toward the pebble again and again. The children followed her, moved the stone, and opened the path. They carried watering cans between the rows while Luna guided them to the driest flowers."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "beat": "resolution",
      "title": "The Garden Dances",
      "description": "Luna flying over revived flowers as children and bees share the garden.",
      "characters": [
        "Luna"
      ],
      "text": "By evening, the garden lifted its bright faces. Bees hummed, children laughed, and Luna danced above the daisies. She had not moved the stone herself, but her tiny wings had shown everyone where help was needed."
    }
